晴れてるヘトセ ずっとずっと手ごめ
clear head... keeping on struggling.

187
00:21:54,144 --> 00:21:56,844
歯車探した峠道
The mountain pass where we searched for gears,

188
00:21:56,844 --> 00:22:00,244
静かにともす青い炎
quietly lighting a blue flame.

189
00:22:00,544 --> 00:22:06,344
たしょう声んでも怖い今日 じっと見つめ合って
Even if it's a bit noisy, today is scary, staring intently at each other.

190
