194
00:22:45,344 --> 00:22:52,044
こんな微妙なニュアンスの違い 絶妙なバランスの甘い目
Such subtle nuance differences, the sweet eyes of exquisite balance.

195
00:22:52,044 --> 00:22:57,644
すべての歯車たちは巧妙に噛み合っている
All the gears are engaging intricately.

196
00:22:58,044 --> 00:23:03,844
数学より冷たい赤い マイクの片寄ったパラダイム 人と成り合わせてたい
Colder than mathematics, a red microphone's biased paradigm, wanting to align with people.

197
00:23:04,244 --> 00:23:10,544
これのきっと誰かのanother life 君だけも私だけも 今だけを国に開きよ
This is surely someone's another life, only you, only me, opening only now to the country.

198
00:23:11,044 --> 00:23:16,844
狭い終えの足をどう 願い事叶わなくとも
No matter if wishes don't come true for the feet at the narrow end,

199
00:23:17,244 --> 00:23:22,544
始まりはなぜ遠いと 気をひそめて
why is the beginning so far? Hiding my breath...

200
00:23:23,344 --> 00:23:29,844
静寂を切り裂いて 空へ羽ばたかせ重ねて
Cutting through the silence, spreading wings toward the sky and overlapping.

201
00:23:30,044 --> 00:23:35,844
待ち望む結末に回ったって粋じゃできないよ
Waiting for the climax, it's not chic if you turn back.

202
00:23:36,544 --> 00:23:41,844
どんな形も傷もかすれた微風寄せて飛び越え
No matter what shape or scar, bringing a faint, fading breeze and leaping over,

203
00:23:42,044 --> 00:23:48,044
今更ねわけに秘めた思い もう後戻りはしない
thoughts hidden in the reason now, I won't turn back anymore.

204
00:23:49,044 --> 00:23:54,844
駆けてく旋律のよ 行こう憧れて先に連れて
